					"In this section, the invoce period is set.\\\r\n",
					"The reference date is 5 days before the current date.\\\r\n",
					"The current date is by default the day on which the job runs.\\\r\n",
					"However, this can be overwritten by uncommenting the next cell of code and inserting the year, month, and day of choice."
